        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Geahaap Naamani",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak Naamani was shirikarajeanda haw bea lugooda sugoocheanda ng'eanyiida Shaamu. Abeeda siida haw gil aba madeeda siidaanyi haw, ak geawal gheang'da aba gideaba aba badaydaanyi, NG'UTAMIIDA ghoadaw fuga Shaamu jooriischooda. Nea ea daruus aba ng'ucheeda, ak ghabwada nih gabearji udamusuura. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu nea gwarita fuga Shaamu nea gaba gharmucheeka, hean geegeanda hudagi was soomjeanda bea ng'eanyiida Israeli, ak ghoah huda gadiyeeda bea gatmooda Naamani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eaweecha ghwalamda hudida bea gadiyeedean ak gwayeesha gatmooda Naamani, “Gidabal gwachi siideanyu haw gwandeayi sea sibaneedida bea ng'eanyiida Samariyahiin, gwachi gajea siihaap udamusureadaanyi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu nea ghwayiiy Naamani ng'asheanji gawa heeda sugoocheanda, ak gwarukusa iidi rugu hudi bea ng'eanyiida Israeliin.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghwalamda sugoocheanda Shaamu ak gwayeesha, “Asi una easiina sugoocheanda Israeli barawajeanda.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gawa ak gageanu dalaantaji damanamughuush bea lapiya, ea banajan sagalamnyooji lah bea dahaabu siguura dahaabu, ea hang'weaka damanamughuush. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghwaat barawajeanda heeda sugoocheanda Israeli, nea gwayeesha, “Inyas ginyasi barawajeanji, ng'ula neajeagu siideanyu bea gadiyeeda headaang'u was Naamani ahaabwa udamusuureadaanyi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu nea ghoasoamwa sugoocheanda Israeli barawajeanda, hean ghabwaashaada hang'weakaaschi nea gwayi, “Neada aniini ghaawaschi ASEETA, jea gwanuus nea gooduudu? Iijeagweanean siisi siida daahaap udamusuureadaanyi? Anala gideaba siisi gagasa jaliida aba heedeanyu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean nea ghwayiiy Elisha was siida ASEETA gideaba nibwaashaada sugoocheanda Israeli hang'weakaaschi. Hean goojeakta siida heeda sugoocheanda nea gwayeesha, “Ghwasaan anda gibwaashaadi hang'weakaagu” Dahina heedeanyu ghamneawa, ak gayghwanal gideaba gwanda sibaneeda jeeda Israeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghwahidu Naamani ea faraasajeagaaschi ea mutukwajeagaaschi, ak ghamiinaada aba gidaghuuta gheeh Elisha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Goojeakta Elisha siida heeda Naamani nea gwayeesha, “Una ahuusheena aba jeedeenda Yordani niba ispwa ak gaygabiikta banyeega saseadaang'u gawuurji gidaghayi bea mwadi nea giimiidu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghwanyareas Naamani ak ghang'eat gawa nea gwayi, “Aniini gwachi geayeenyi gaygwardu ghwahidu heedeanyu ak ghamiinaada ak ghamwaash ASEETA aba gheawunga NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEATAANYI, ak ghwayiin geatindaanyi headak, ak ghwanung' dahaabwa udamusuura. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neada eenda Abana ea Fapari, was eeniga Dameski mang'wana ea ghang'al beega sean bea ng'eanyiida Israeli? Neada ea mwammuusi deahuushi aba jeedida ak ghamiidu?” Ghwayam geaw ak ghang'eat gawa nea ninyareas. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gaweesa fugaaschi bea gadiyeeda ak gwayeesha, “Siida mureeda, heapi inyas gwachi gwayeeshiineey sibaneeda gideaba sina ng'asheanda haw, heapi maysina? Neada ea mwang'ala gideaba gwayeeshiineey, ‘una ahuusheena ak giimiidu’?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghwararang'aada ak ghoabita jeedeenda Yordani niba ispwa gawuurji gidarukusiinda siida ASEETA. Hean gabiiksiinyi mughooka saseadaanyi ea gawuurji saseadaanyi dea baleanda mwanang' ak ghamiidu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gabiikta heedeaba siidida bea ASEETEAN, niny ea bareandaanyi sean. Ghwahidu ak ghamiinaada bea madeadaanyi ak gwayeesha, “Ng'ula biissa naanali gideaba ASEETA manda hichnuut, geaghus jeeda ng'eanyiida Israeli. Asi geamuscheey ang'waanya gidagusguseega leabu heeda siidaang'u bea gadiyeeda.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwalamda Elisha ak gwayeesha, “Gawuurji gidabiideata NG'UTAMIIDA eagadiyeesi maydaang'waay gida wassean.” Hean gwadiing'sa ghoang'waay ak ghaheawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghwalamda Naamani ak gwayeesha, “Adak ii masunu, abeeda ginung' eataw siidaang'u bea gadiyeeda sareenda sigeeda ammu ghwasar jiiru iyeenya bea digeeniga. Aba gideaba siidaang'u bea gadiyeeda maygudu ghoadayda haleanjeeda sisabwa geadi bea ghadooweeda sighwarda. Nea mayghoadaw lukghumeeda aseecheeka was sean, geaghus NG'UTAMIIDA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghaararji gideaba NG'UTAMIIDA gaygwasamsean, aba damanda beawa siideanyu haw jeeda gheeda aseeta siguura Rimoni ghabwat aba hoowa. Nea geaghus geatindeanyu, nea eara aniini iyaahiinyi geaw aba gheeh Rimoni dabwat, aba huumwa NG'UTAMIIDA gaygwasamsean aba ng'asheanji.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwayeesha Elisha Naamani, “Una nea gibea hoyyoo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghang'eat Naamani gawa, nea damanda miigwasheagiit. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwalamda Gehasi as siida gadiyeeda Elisha, was siida ASEETA ak gwayi, “Ng'ula siideanyu haw nisiksa Naamani was siida Shaamu gawa nea miighoang'waay haleanjeeda gwachi eassa, aba gidabiideata NG'UTAMIIDA gaydafwach daat geeshta danyas gil aba headaanyi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghwaat Gehasi geeshta Naamani, ang'wearda Naamani ak ghwadaah siida duubu geeshtaanyi nea gafaju, hean ghwararang'aana uhuuda mutukwajeandaanyi ak gawa roonyeeda. Ak gwayeesha, “Seayu?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwayeesha, “Seayu gil. Goojeaknean siideanyu haw nea gwayi, ‘Naanyaschi rabas iyeenya was giinealanga sibanga. Nea gwaleabu ng'eanyiida heayeeniga Efraimu, gwayi geamuscheey adawa dalaanteeda lapiya ea hang'weaka iyeenya bea ghweelmeeda.’” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwalamda Naamani ak gwayeesha, “Mwasa geanda dalaantaji iyeenya.” Gwadiing'sa ak gwarasa jeeda shageeni iyeenya dalaantaji iyeenya bea lapiya ea hang'weak iyeenya bea ghweelmeeda ak ghwanung' ghwasar fih iyeenya bea gadiyeeda, ak gaweay nea goosheedeawa niny. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu nea geahita heayeeda mida Elisha gageanda Gehasi shageenigiga asiyeenyean. Ak ghwasar ghwaat gheanyi, nea ghwanung' gabiikta fuga gadiyeeda bea Naamani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gawa niny gah ak ghamiinaada aba madeeda siidaanyi haw. Hean ghwalamda Elisha ak gwayeesha, “Gileabu yeenu Gehasi?” Ak gwayeesha, “Siidaang'u bea gadiyeeda miigawa hich.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghwalamda ak gwayeesha, “Neada ea miyeeteayeena aba jeeda guroorooda damanda rarang'aana siidida badayda mutukwajeandaanyi ak ghwahidu ghwadeaptaneey. Heapi nih damanda jea eang'waanya lapiya, ea hang'weaka, ea madameega saytuunajeega, ea sabiibu ea gisilga ea dugwa, ghana fuga gadiyeeda ghana haweega gadiyeeda? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.5.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.5.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 5:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
